1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,125
Near Kadesh, the Egyptians met two local nomads.

2
00:00:05,175 --> 00:00:07,605
They said they wanted to switch sides.

3
00:00:07,655 --> 00:00:10,065
And they had great news.

4
00:00:10,115 --> 00:00:14,885
The Hittite army was far away, up north near Aleppo.

5
00:00:14,935 --> 00:00:18,125
Too scared to face the mighty pharaoh.

6
00:00:18,335 --> 00:00:20,725
Ramesses loved this.

7
00:00:20,775 --> 00:00:22,285
He didn't check.

8
00:00:22,335 --> 00:00:28,005
He took his first division, Amun, and raced ahead to build his camp right next to

9
00:00:28,055 --> 00:00:28,405
Kadesh.

10
00:00:28,455 --> 00:00:33,365
The rest of his army was strung out for miles behind him.

11
00:00:33,415 --> 00:00:36,045
There was just one problem.

12
00:00:36,215 --> 00:00:39,745
The two nomads were Hittite spies.

13
00:00:40,095 --> 00:00:45,005
The entire Hittite army was hiding on the other side of the city.

14
00:00:45,055 --> 00:00:46,605
Thousands of chariots.

15
00:00:46,655 --> 00:00:50,320
Close enough to see the Egyptian campfires.

